{{!
    @template local_coursegen/activity_type_picker

    The first steps of the chat to create an activity, inside the chat itself: what was chosen so far, the types the
    AI can create and, for H5P, its kinds. The tiles are Moodle's own chooser tiles.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * typeitems array  - The chooser items of the types the AI can create.
    * kinditems array  - The chooser items of the H5P kinds.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "typeitems": [
            {"name": "forum", "title": "Forum", "link": "?add=forum", "icon": "<img class='icon' src='https://example.com/forum.svg' alt=''>", "componentname": "mod_forum", "purpose": "collaboration", "branded": 0, "legacyitem": true}
        ],
        "kinditems": []
{{!
    @template local_coursegen/presentation_editor_ai

    The bar to ask the AI to change a part of a slide.

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
<div class="d-flex align-items-center my-2 p-2 rounded" style="gap: .5rem; background: #f3f0ff;" data-region="local_coursegen/pe/aibar">
    <i class="fa fa-magic text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm flex-fill" data-region="local_coursegen/pe/aiinput"
           placeholder="{{#str}} pe_ai_placeholder, local_coursegen {{/str}}" aria-label="{{#str}} pe_ai_zone, local_coursegen {{/str}}">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-action="local_coursegen/pe/aiapply">{{#str}} pe_ai_apply, local_coursegen {{/str}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" data-action="local_coursegen/pe/aicancel" aria-label="{{#str}} pe_ai_cancel, local_coursegen {{/str}}"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
</div>
